WEBVTT

00:12:59.809 --> 00:13:05.120
(Applause)

00:13:05.889 --> 00:13:08.004
We have to recognize
a couple of things here.

00:13:08.028 --> 00:13:10.376
One is that human talent
is tremendously diverse.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.203
People have very different aptitudes.

00:13:12.227 --> 00:13:15.976
I worked out recently
that I was given a guitar as a kid

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.976
at about the same time
that Eric Clapton got his first guitar.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.604
(Laughter)

00:13:20.628 --> 00:13:22.860
It worked out for Eric,
that's all I'm saying.

00:13:22.884 --> 00:13:23.906
(Laughter)

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:25.017
In a way --

00:13:26.145 --> 00:13:27.412
it did not for me.

00:13:27.436 --> 00:13:29.977
I could not get this thing to work